{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受提示不如X细腻，缺少随音乐小节出现的具体音型、声部动作和细微情绪转折，部分音乐变化被概括掉了。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点加亮和随乐句出现的感受提示，更方便观众快速扫视，也更容易捕捉音乐中细微的情绪变化。但Y用完整、自然的因果关系把人物的委屈、怀念、孤独、动摇和最终选择串了起来，尤其让人明白他为什么既想找回亲近又不愿回去受委屈。对于没有读过原文的普通观众，Y在人物理解和整体叙事上的优势更重要，因此综合选择Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c655c269-c2dd-4578-b774-3948193de404", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T215500494588Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:56:07.345544+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd36857a2d04b8731ea38774f9103353ebbc1698cb34bda47820bcadccdec4b5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238